	(text "SPI mode 0, bit-banged on the MSSP pins (RC3 SCK, RC4 SDI, RC5 SDO), CS on RC2.\nU2 is a 23LC1024 (128K x 8 SPI SRAM, 2.5-5.5 V) drawn with the 25LCxxx symbol: same DIP-8 pinout.\nC3 decouples U1, C4 decouples U2."
